  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np28:2.38": "“Taken on trust” refers to a situation where you have an agreement with a close friend that you may take their belongings on trust. The conditions for taking on trust are set out at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-kd8/en/brahmali#19.1.5'>Kd 8:19.1.5</a>. ",
